# Implementation Plan: Forced Cosma Export

To bypass the `npx cosma export` CLI issues on Windows, I will use a direct Node.js script that imports the Cosma library and executes the export logic programmatically.

## Proposed Changes

### [Cosma Workspace]

#### [NEW] [force_export.js](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/Ecosistema_Fintech_Global/cosma_workspace/force_export.js)
A script that uses the `@graphlab-fr/cosma` library to:
1. Load the configuration from [cosma.yml](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/Ecosistema_Fintech_Global/cosma.yml).
2. Execute the model generation.
3. Export the static web visualization to the `export` directory.

